# The only commands and flags hey-gordy keeps, one `.surface` line per entry.
#
# hey-gordy is the restricted build an agent reaches over SSH. It reads mail,
# organizes it, and writes drafts; it never sends, forwards, shares, screens,
# or touches credentials. Anything upstream adds is excluded until listed here.
# Global flags are `hey --<flag>` lines.
